      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 3.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.57,
      "end_seconds": 5.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Hello doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.05,
      "end_seconds": 9.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.47,
      "end_seconds": 17.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "Um, you know, so... a blocked ear. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.51,
      "end_seconds": 20.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.39,
      "end_seconds": 27.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Uh, um, I've had it for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.9,
      "end_seconds": 32.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.53,
      "end_seconds": 48.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.55,
      "end_seconds": 68.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "okay: pressure 128 over 76, height 170 centimetres, weight 72 kilos, pulse 73, temperature is 36.9 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.81,
      "end_seconds": 70.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.48,
      "end_seconds": 77.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.91,
      "end_seconds": 84.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.39,
      "end_seconds": 88.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.97,
      "end_seconds": 102.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "There's a lot of wax blocking the right ear canal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.5,
      "end_seconds": 108.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.66,
      "end_seconds": 129.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "have you noticed dizziness ear pain or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.82,
      "end_seconds": 134.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "No dizziness, ear pain or discharge, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.64,
      "end_seconds": 136.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.39,
      "end_seconds": 140.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "nothing on the skin, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.66,
      "end_seconds": 146.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.76,
      "end_seconds": 149.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "No no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.42,
      "end_seconds": 168.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.86,
      "end_seconds": 172.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "My partner and our baby"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.96,
      "end_seconds": 181.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.91,
      "end_seconds": 187.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.6,
      "end_seconds": 192.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.91,
      "end_seconds": 196.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.92,
      "end_seconds": 215.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.62,
      "end_seconds": 224.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "not currently, but as a youngster diclofenac gave me swelling of my lips"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.24,
      "end_seconds": 228.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.94,
      "end_seconds": 232.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.86,
      "end_seconds": 249.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is earwax blocking the ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.68,
      "end_seconds": 253.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "is this serious doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.06,
      "end_seconds": 279.48,
      "duration_seconds": 25.42,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with earwax blocking the ear do well once it's treated properly. I'm going to order ear irrigation, for wax. Use the olive oil drops for a week and then we'll syringe the ear. Keep an eye out, and if you get ear pain or dizziness, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.57,
      "end_seconds": 283.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "okay, makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.92,
      "end_seconds": 295.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "please come and see me in one week. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.06,
      "end_seconds": 298.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.68,
      "end_seconds": 300.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
